<view class="page requests-page"><view class="page-head"><view><text class="eyebrow">管理员确认</text><text class="title">加入申请</text></view></view><view class="notice error" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点此重试</view><view class="skeleton" wx:if="{{loading}}"></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !requests.length}}"><view class="empty-mark">✓</view><text class="section-title">没有待处理申请</text><text class="muted">新的申请会出现在这里。</text></view><view class="card request-card" wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id"><view class="request-head"><view class="grow"><text class="section-title request-title">{{item.relationship_label}}申请加入</text><text class="muted tiny">{{item.createdLabel}}</text></view><text class="request-code">申请码 {{item.request_code}}</text></view><text class="muted small block request-copy">请与申请人核对申请码，再选择协作权限。确认后，这条邀请会立即失效。</text><view class="role-actions"><button disabled="{{actingId}}" loading="{{actingId === item.id}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-role="viewer" bindtap="approve">同意 · 仅查看</button><button disabled="{{actingId}}" loading="{{actingId === item.id}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-role="editor" bindtap="approve">同意 · 可记录</button><button disabled="{{actingId}}" loading="{{actingId === item.id}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-role="manager" bindtap="approve">同意 · 管理员</button></view><button class="reject" disabled="{{actingId}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="reject">拒绝申请</button></view></view>
